trans-unit.source:
{VAR_SELECT, select, division {Green means every RFI in that division met its SLA target; red means at least one breached —
      same pass/fail convention as the main SLA Compliance chart.} other {Green means every RFI in that sub-division met its SLA target; red means at least one breached —
